flowchart TB
Upload[Owned bounded TXT or PDF upload] --> Parse[Validate and sandbox PDF extraction]
Parse --> Chunk[Bounded text chunks]
Chunk --> Embed[Configured versioned embedding adapter]
Embed --> CF[Workers AI Qwen3 embedding staging path]
CF --> MRL[1024 dimensions truncated to 256 and normalized]
MRL --> Vector[pgvector chunks and embedding_version]
Question[Owned query] --> Query[Matching query embedding version]
Query --> Retrieve[User document and version filtered cosine retrieval]
Vector --> Retrieve
Retrieve --> Context[Attributed untrusted source context]
Context --> Model[Configured generation adapter]
Model --> Answer[Answer and persisted source citations]
Failure[Embedding outage] --> Retain[Fail request; preserve old index on reindex]
Delete[Owned document delete] --> Cascade[Remove chunks via relationships]
Lexical[Explicit lexical baseline for development] -. separate labelled profile .-> Embed
